        "isAnswerable": true,
        "name": "Q&A",
        "slug": "q-a",
        "updatedAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z"
    },
    "closed": true,
    "closedAt": "2025-06-11T16:59:06Z",
    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, it is possible with default [`choose_marked` action](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L441) (which by default [populates quickfix list](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1040-L1041) if appropriate). So:\r\n- Select all matched items with `<C-a>` (or [`mark_all`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L515-L516) mapping in general).\r\n- Press `<M-CR>` (or [`choose_marked`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L494-L495) in general).\r\n\r\nThis workflow is more flexible and allows marking items after several queries. So:\r\n- Limit matches first time. For example, type `.lua$` query.\r\n- Press `<C-a>` to mark all items.\r\n- Clear the query with `<C-u>` and limit matches more. For example, type `^nvim`.\r\n- Press `<C-a>`.\r\n- Repeat until necessary.\r\n- Press `<M-CR>` to put all marked items across several queries to quickfix list.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, it is possible with default <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L441\"><code class=\"notranslate\">choose_marked</code> action</a> (which by default <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1040-L1041\">populates quickfix list</a> if appropriate). So:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Select all matched items with <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-a&gt;</code> (or <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L515-L516\"><code class=\"notranslate\">mark_all</code></a> mapping in general).</li>\n<li>Press <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;M-CR&gt;</code> (or <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35e1767f4cd7dde51256eabae7349a5283a43cba/doc/mini-pick.txt#L494-L495\"><code class=\"notranslate\">choose_marked</code></a> in general).</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This workflow is more flexible and allows marking items after several queries. So:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Limit matches first time. For example, type <code class=\"notranslate\">.lua$</code> query.</li>\n<li>Press <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-a&gt;</code> to mark all items.</li>\n<li>Clear the query with <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-u&gt;</code> and limit matches more. For example, type <code class=\"notranslate\">^nvim</code>.</li>\n<li>Press <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-a&gt;</code>.</li>\n<li>Repeat until necessary.</li>\n<li>Press <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;M-CR&gt;</code> to put all marked items across several queries to quickfix list.</li>\n</ul>",
            "bodyText": "Yes, it is possible with default choose_marked action (which by default populates quickfix list if appropriate). So:\n\nSelect all matched items with <C-a> (or mark_all mapping in general).\nPress <M-CR> (or choose_marked in general).\n\nThis workflow is more flexible and allows marking items after several queries. So:\n\nLimit matches first time. For example, type .lua$ query.\nPress <C-a> to mark all items.\nClear the query with <C-u> and limit matches more. For example, type ^nvim.\nPress <C-a>.\nRepeat until necessary.\nPress <M-CR> to put all marked items across several queries to quickfix list.",
